/* Embeds src/starfish.manifest into starfish.exe.

   Without it a MinGW build has no manifest, Windows falls back to pre-Windows-8
   compatibility behaviour, and WS_EX_LAYERED cannot be added to a child window:
   the hosted zones are then never composited by DWM (ADR-4, T-020).

   1  = CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID
   24 = RT_MANIFEST */
1 24 "starfish.manifest"
